---
layout: layouts/app.njk
title: Scope and sequence
description: Every skill in Teach Direct, the lesson where each step is taught, and the standard it meets.
permalink: /curriculum/
---
<div class="content">
  <header class="screen__head">
    <h1 class="screen__title">Scope and sequence</h1>
    <p class="screen__lead">Every skill the program teaches, and the lesson where each step begins. Each lesson draws short exercises from several skills. A step is taught, practiced for the next lessons, and then reviewed at widening intervals for the rest of the level.</p>
  </header>
  <p class="muted small">Standards are from the Common Core for Kindergarten and First Grade and from the Head Start Early Learning Outcomes Framework (ELOF) for Pre-K.</p>

  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__number">{{ program.lessons.length }}</span><span class="stat__label">Lessons</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__number">{{ program.tests.length }}</span><span class="stat__label">Mastery tests</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__number">{{ program.levels.length }}</span><span class="stat__label">Levels</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat__number">4&ndash;7</span><span class="stat__label">Ages</span></div>
  </div>

  {% for s in program.subjects %}
  {% if program.subjects.length > 1 %}<h2 class="eyebrow eyebrow--section">{{ s.name }}</h2>{% endif %}
  {% for level in program.levels %}{% if level.subject == s.id %}
  <details class="fold" id="{{ level.id }}"{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
    <summary><h2 class="fold__h">{{ level.name }}</h2></summary>
    <div class="fold__body">
      <p class="scope__facts">{{ level.lessons }} lessons · {{ level.minutes }} minutes each · {% if level.optional %}{{ level.age }}{% else %}for a child of {{ level.age }}{% endif %} · <a href="{{ level.url }}">Open the level</a></p>
      <p>{{ level.endsWith }}</p>
      {% for t in level.tracks %}
      <div class="scope__track">
        <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
        <p class="scope__std">{{ t.standard }}</p>
        <p class="scope__sum">{{ t.summary }}</p>
        <ul class="scope__units">{% for u in t.units %}<li><a class="scope__unit" href="/{{ level.slug }}/lesson-{{ u.lesson | pad(3) }}/"><span class="scope__n">{{ u.lesson }}</span><span>{{ u.label }}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </details>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  {% endfor %}
</div>
